# ============================================================
# .dockerignore — Jev Bot Lab v20.8.1
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# v20.8.1 FIX (H2 — SECRETY): `COPY app/ ./` used to bake host
# node_modules (platform-mismatched binaries), any local .env
# (SECRETS IN THE IMAGE), runtime state and test junk into the
# image. Now excluded at build-context level.
# ============================================================
app/node_modules
app/dist
app/.env
app/.env.*
app/server/data
app/data
app/.test-data*
app/coverage
app/test
# v20.8.4 FIX (H3 — context gaps): a host that ran `npm --prefix
# telegram-bot install` or trained models locally would bake
# platform-mismatched node_modules OVER the clean ci layer and leak
# pkl/parquet store artifacts into the node image (exactly the class
# this file exists to block).
app/telegram-bot/node_modules
app/telegram-bot/.env
app/ml-service/store
app/ml-service/__pycache__
app/backups
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.github
state
cache
*.zip
download
